            "sid": "JOS 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw abo bagabo b’Abisirayeli bakora nk’uko Yosuwa yababariye, bāndūra amabuye cumi n’abiri muri Yorodani, nk’uk’ Uhoraho yabariye Yosuwa, angana n’igitigiri c’imiryango y’Abisirayeli; barayajabukana, bayashikana aho bagiye kurāra, bayaturaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa na we ashinga amabuye cumi n’abiri nyene muri Yorodani, ah’ abaherezi bareruye isandugu y’ isezerano bahagaze: kandi ni ho akiri na bugingo n’ubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw abo baherezi bareruye iyo sandugu bari bahagaze muri Yorodani, gushitsa ah’ ivyo Uhoraho yabariye Yosuwa kubgira abantu vyarangiriye vyose, bihwanye n’ivyo Mose yari yarabariye Yosuwa vyose: nuko ni kw abantu bihuse, barajabuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abantu bose bamaze kujabuka, isandugu y’ Uhoraho irajabuka, ireruwe n’ abaherezi, abantu barorēra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
