        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ Abareyubeni n’Abagadi n’igihimba c’umuryango wa Manase ni bo bagiye imbere y’ abandi Bisirayeli mu kujabuka, bītwaje ibirwanishwa, nk’uko Mose yari yarababariye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
