          "text": "Maz’ abaherezi bareruye iyo sandugu y’ isezerano ry’Uhoraho bavuye muri Yorodani, bashitse i musozi, amazi ya Yorodani asubira gutemba aho yahora, arenga inkombe, nk’uko yar’ asanzwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.18",
